"succeeded|failed|cancelled"}`. On automatic reconnect, browser `EventSource` sends the standard `Last-Event-ID` 
header; the server replays events with greater sequence values from a bounded ring (1000 events). If the requested ID 
predates the retained buffer, emit a snapshot/reset event before live events. The client also deduplicates by 
`sequence`.
